ng on port 8777; `resolve_bind_host` and `main()` complete the entry path; a `_heartbeat_watchdog` thread runs alongside (lines 7930â€“8093).\n\n**Findings / notes.** The file is large (8,093 lines); the bulk is HTML/JS generation (`generate_html` â‰ˆ1,950 lines and `render_project_window_html` â‰ˆ1,790 lines). Default bind is loopback `127.0.0.1:8777`. No errors observed in the read regions.\n\n**Provenance:** claims above are read directly from `anchor_gui.py` (line numbers cited). I did not verify runtime behavior â€” only the source structure.","stop_reason":"end_turn","session_id":"2b5cb374-2ef1-4e73-bda7-039b7c4b1bb4","total_cost_usd":0.232408,"usage":{"input_tokens":644,"cache_creation_input_tokens":5755,"cache_read_input_tokens":198200,"output_tokens":2876,"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":5755,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"not_available","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":2008,"cache_read_input_tokens":51595,"cache_creation_input_tokens":2918,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":2918},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard"},"modelUsage":{"claude-haiku-4-5-20251001":{"inputTokens":543,"outputTokens":19,"cacheReadInputTokens":0,"cacheCreationInputTokens":0,"webSearchRequests":0,"costUSD":0.000638,"contextWindow":200000,"maxOutputTokens":32000},"claude-opus-4-8[1m]":{"inputTokens":644,"outputTokens":2876,"cacheReadInputTokens":198200,"cacheCreationInputTokens":5755,"webSearchRequests":0,"costUSD":0.23177000000000003,"contextWindow":1000000,"maxOutputTokens":64000}},"permission_denials":[],"terminal_reason":"completed","fast_mode_state":"off","uuid":"057c948b-776d-4e3c-a365-562cfd5efd70"}
